  "body": "Positioned in a sought-after Half Moon Bay location, this home offers a practical and flexible layout across two levels, ideal for families, extended living, or work-from-home setups.\r\n\r\nUpstairs (main living level):\r\nThe heart of the home features a spacious open-plan living and dining area with high ceilings, creating a bright and airy feel. The layout flows through to multiple decks, providing great indoor-outdoor connection.\r\n\r\nThere are two bedrooms on this level, including a generous master with walk-in wardrobe, serviced by a family bathroom plus separate toilet. The kitchen sits centrally, functional and well-positioned for everyday living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs:\r\nOffers two additional bedrooms, a bathroom, and a separate foyer/entry area, providing excellent separation. This level works well for teenagers, guests, or potential home office / work-from-home use.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms across two levels\r\n• Multiple decks with good outdoor flow\r\n• High ceiling living area with great natural light\r\n• Flexible layout for extended family or dual living\r\n• Approx. 150m² floor area\r\n• Solid 1970s construction\r\n\r\nLocation is a major highlight – close to Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services to the CBD, cafes, and local shops. Zoned for Pigeon Mountain Primary, Farm Cove Intermediate, and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nA great opportunity in a quality neighbourhood – whether you’re looking to live in or invest.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today to arrange a viewing, or come along to one of our open homes. Opportunities in this location don’t last long.",
